<title>THAILAND: Finance One in merger talks -govt source.</title>
<headline>Finance One in merger talks -govt source.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's ailing Finance One and finance and securities firm KrungThai Thanakit Plc are holding merger talks with the backing of Krung Thai Bank in which the finance ministry has a majority stake, a senior government source said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>He told Reuters that the talks had been going on for a month now and details were being worked out to conclude the deal to set up a merged finance company.</p>
</text>
